IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/08/Launch-Kit-Houston-Funko-Pop-Mart-II.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08
 /Launch-Kit-Houston-Funko-Pop-Mart-II.png
UID:H6qTQmxkjqayYdZRjAeGS
SUMMARY:Houston Funko Pop Mart II
DTSTAMP:20260811T095926Z
DTSTART:20260823T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Funko Pop Mart II – The Ultimate Funko Marketplace\nHou
	ston Funko Pop Show II is THE place for Funko Pop collectors. Explore vend
	ors specializing in these shelf-worthy collectibles\, featuring vaulted Po
	ps\, Chase variants\, convention exclusives\, signed Funko Pops\, rares\, 
	and the latest releases. Browse anime\, Marvel\, DC\, Disney\, Pokémon\, h
	orror\, sports\, Star Wars\, and more while connecting with fellow collect
	ors who share the hobby. Bring your trade pile\, track down the missing pi
	eces in your collection\, and discover Funko Pops that rarely make it to s
	tore shelves. \n  \n📅 Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 – 10AM–6PM \n📍 9700 Bisson
	net St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n🎟 FREE Entry · FREE Parking \n  \nEven
	t Highlights\n🔎 A Collector’s Paradise\nLooking for SDCC/NYCC convention e
	xclusives? Flocked variants? Glow-in-the-dark or sticker exclusives? That 
	fandom Funko that sold out before you grabbed one? Our vendors are your be
	st bet. Aisles of Marvel\, DC\, pop culture\, anime\, horror\, gaming\, an
	d sports figures are ready to sell. Come find yours. \n  \n💰Buy\, Sell\, a
	nd Trade All Day\nBring your pops to trade\, sell\, or upgrade! Collectors
	 and vendors will be buying\, selling\, and trading all day\, so it’s the 
	perfect opportunity to make a deal and find that elusive figure you’ve bee
	n searching for. \n  \n🛍️ Interested in Vending?\nBring your Funko Pop inve
	ntory and table with us. https://forms.gle/pUuxtBi5hUHoMaELA \nDon’t let t
	hat missing variant get away! Houston Funko Pop Mart II pops off August 23
	.\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-funko-pop-mart-ii/\n\nFrom CCS
	 Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-funko-pop-mart-ii/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
