SUMMARY:Happy Birthday to the World! A Rosh Hashanah Family Celebration  
DTSTAMP:20260811T095926Z
DTSTART:20260830T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Rosh Hashanah with a joyful “Happy Birthday to the Wo
	rld” celebration! This special family event is presented in partnership wi
	th the Evelyn Rubenstein JCC\, PJ Library and the Jewish Federation of Gre
	ater Houston.\n\nJoin us on the last Sunday in August as we welcome the Je
	wish New Year. In Jewish tradition\, Rosh Hashanah is known as Yom Harat O
	lam\, the birthday of the world.\nBring the whole family for an afternoon 
	filled with festive fun\, meaningful traditions and hands-on activities th
	at celebrate the sweetness of the New Year. Children and families will enj
	oy music\, inflatables\, games\, crafts\, story time\, a photo booth and m
	uch more!\n\n\nFace Painting\n\n\nApple Dipping Station\n\n\nInflatables\n
	\n\nBalloon Art\n\n\nFamily Photo Ops\n\n\nGiant Lawn Games\n\n\nArts & Cr
	afts\n\n\nCost: FREE\, though advance registration is required!  Please RS
	VP one time per family.\n\nhttps://www.erjcchouston.org/event/happy-birthd
	ay-world/\n\nFrom ERJCC Houston
URL:https://www.erjcchouston.org/event/happy-birthday-world/
LOCATION:Merfish Teen Center\, 9000 S. Rice\, Houston\, TX\, 77096
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:erjcc-houston
CATEGORIES:ERJCC Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
